get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/1
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  ## Account read

  Read a game account by numeric id or account name.

  - Method and path: `GET /api/v1/accounts/1`. Replace `1` with another numeric id or an account
    **username** such as `ADMIN`.
  - Path parameters: `account` — numeric values up to 10 digits are treated as account ids; any
    other value is treated as a username (case-insensitive; letters, digits, `_`, `-`, `.`, max 17).
  - Query parameters: none.
  - Body: none.
  - Signature headers: `X-GM-Timestamp`, `X-GM-Nonce`, `X-GM-Signature`, set by `collection.bru`.
    No `X-GM-Actor`, no RBAC permission.
  - Success: `200` with `{"id","username","security","online"}`. `security` is the realm security
    level; `0` is a player.
  - Failure: `401 unauthorized`, `404 target_not_found` when the account does not exist,
    `405 method_not_allowed`, `409 replayed_nonce`, `429 rate_limited`, `503 world_unavailable`.

  The read runs on the world thread; a stalled world thread returns `503`.
}
